===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*treb-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|taverne}}, from {{der|en|fro|taverne||wine shop}}, from {{der|en|la|taberna||inn}}. {{doublet|en|taberna|taverna}}.

